{
  "title": "Products: Prices, Sales and Shop Pages for Your Store | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "A store starts with what it sells. When prices, pictures and rules live in spreadsheets and scattered pages, they drift out of date, and not everything you show is meant for a cart. The CrestApps Products module keeps the price with the content: a product is a page of your site with a price, a SKU, sale rules and pictures, and the shop page, the cart and the orders all read the same price.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why a product's price lives with its content\n• How products, product listings and currencies fit together\n• Adding a currency and a product, with a price, compare-at price, SKU and pictures\n• Sale prices, quantity limits, volume and role discounts, and add-ons\n• Product types, sales modes and price display\n• Product listing pages with filters, sorting, paging and layout\n• Comparison, upsells, cross-sells, grouped products and bundles\n• Product feeds and product search indexes",
